<path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M2.55806 6.29544C2.46043 6.19781 2.46043 6.03952 2.55806 5.94189L3.44195 5.058C3.53958 4.96037 3.69787 4.96037 3.7955 5.058L8.00001 9.26251L12.2045 5.058C12.3021 4.96037 12.4604 4.96037 12.5581 5.058L13.4419 5.94189C13.5396 6.03952 13.5396 6.19781 13.4419 6.29544L8.17678 11.5606C8.07915 11.6582 7.92086 11.6582 7.82323 11.5606L2.55806 6.29544Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div><nav class="bt-navbar-mobile-dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="bt-navbar-dropdown-link-list"><a href="/destinations/ocean-tours" class="bt-navbar-dropdown-link w-inline-block"><div class="bt-navbar-text-wrapper"><div class="bt-text-style-regular color-white">Ocean Tours</div></div></a><a href="/destinations/jungle-tours" class="bt-navbar-dropdown-link w-inline-block"><div class="bt-navbar-text-wrapper"><div class="bt-text-style-regular color-white">Jungle Tours</div></div></a><a href="/destinations/island-tours" class="bt-navbar-dropdown-link w-inline-block"><div class="bt-navbar-text-wrapper"><div class="bt-text-style-regular color-white">Island Tours</div></div></a></div></nav></div><a href="/offers" class="bt-navbar-link w-nav-link">Special Offers</a><a href="/about-us" aria-current="page" class="bt-navbar-link w-nav-link w--current">About us</a><a href="/blog" class="bt-navbar-link w-nav-link">Blog</a></div><div class="bt-navbar-menu-buttons"><a href="/plan-trip" class="bt-button w-button">Plan Trip</a></div></nav><div class="bt-navbar-menu-button w-nav-button"><div class="bt-menu-icon"><div class="bt-menu-icon_line-top"></div><div class="bt-menu-icon-line-middle"><div class="bt-menu-icon-line-middle-inner"></div></div><div class="bt-menu-icon_line-bottom"></div></div></div></div></div><header class="bt-section-header"><div class="bt-padding-global"><div class="bt-container-large"><div class="bt-padding-section-large size-xxl"><div class="bt-max-width-large"><div class="bt-margin-bottom margin-small"><h1 class="bt-heading-style-h2 color-white">Who we are!</h1></div><p class="bt-text-style-regular color-white">At Bali Travel, we create personalized experiences that showcase the best of Bali—stunning beaches, vibrant culture, and hidden gems. From boutique hotels to guided tours, we take care of every detail, ensuring your journey is seamless and unforgettable.</p><div class="bt-margin-top margin-medium"><div class="bt-button-group"><a href="/plan-trip" class="bt-button w-button">Plan your trip</a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="bt-header-background-image-wrapper"><div class="bt-image-overlay-layer"></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/671999e32abab93f11e9b1f7_polina-kuzovkova-VdoE0Ep9kaM-unsplash.avif" loading="eager" sizes="(max-width: 1919px) 100vw, 1920px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/671999e32abab93f11e9b1f7_polina-kuzovkova-VdoE0Ep9kaM-unsplash-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/671999e32abab93f11e9b1f7_polina-kuzovkova-VdoE0Ep9kaM-unsplash-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/671999e32abab93f11e9b1f7_polina-kuzovkova-VdoE0Ep9kaM-unsplash-p-1080.avif 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/671999e32abab93f11e9b1f7_polina-kuzovkova-VdoE0Ep9kaM-unsplash.avif 1920w" alt="Bali Temple" class="bt-header-background-image"/></div></header><section class="bt-section-layout-about-us"><div class="bt-padding-global"><div class="bt-container-large"><div class="bt-padding-section-large"><div class="bt-layout-about-us-component"><div class="w-layout-grid bt-layout-about-us-content"><div class="bt-layout-about-us-content-left"><div class="bt-margin-bottom margin-small"><h2 blocks-non-deletable="true" class="bt-heading-style-h2">Bali Travel</h2></div><div class="bt-margin-bottom margin-medium"><p class="bt-text-style-regular">Bali Travel is your trusted partner in exploring the Island of the Gods. With a deep love for Bali and years of expertise, we specialize in curating personalized itineraries that capture the beauty, culture, and spirit of the island. Whether you&#x27;re dreaming of a relaxing beachfront escape, a cultural adventure through ancient temples, or an action-packed surf trip, we tailor every experience to suit your preferences.<br/><br/>Our services include carefully selected boutique accommodations, private tours with local guides, and seamless airport transfers, ensuring your vacation is as smooth as it is memorable. At Bali Travel, we believe in going beyond the ordinary, introducing travelers to hidden gems and authentic experiences that truly capture the essence of Bali. <br/><br/>Let us handle the details, so you can focus on making lifelong memories.</p></div></div><div class="bt-layout-about-us-image-wrapper"><img sizes="(max-width: 2977px) 100vw, 2977px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/67183e41a8923dca6947cd8c_aron-visuals-1kdIG_258bU-unsplash%20(1)-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/67183e41a8923dca6947cd8c_aron-visuals-1kdIG_258bU-unsplash%20(1)-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/67183e41a8923dca6947cd8c_aron-visuals-1kdIG_258bU-unsplash%20(1)-p-1080.avif 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/67183e41a8923dca6947cd8c_aron-visuals-1kdIG_258bU-unsplash%20(1)-p-1600.avif 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/67183e41a8923dca6947cd8c_aron-visuals-1kdIG_258bU-unsplash%20(1).avif 2977w" alt="Bali Temple" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/67183e41a8923dca6947cd8c_aron-visuals-1kdIG_258bU-unsplash%20(1).avif" loading="lazy" class="bt-layout-about-us-image"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="bt-section-layout-team"><div class="bt-padding-global"><div class="bt-container-large"><div class="bt-padding-section-large"><div class="bt-layout-team-component"><div class="bt-layout-team-header"><div class="bt-text-align-center"><div class="bt-max-width-large align-center"><div class="bt-margin-bottom margin-small"><h2 blocks-non-deletable="true" class="bt-heading-style-h2">MEET the team</h2></div><p class="bt-text-style-regular">Our team at Bali Travel is made up of passionate travelers and local experts dedicated to crafting unforgettable experiences. From personalised itineraries to insider tours, we handle every detail, ensuring your journey is seamless and extraordinary. Let us share our love for Bali and make your adventure truly special.</p></div></div></div><div class="w-layout-grid bt-layout-team-list"><div class="bt-layout-team-item"><div class="bt-margin-bottom margin-small"><div class="bt-layout-team-image-wrapper"><img sizes="(max-width: 1919px) 100vw, 1920px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/671843c6898b1c3a97234c98_polina-kuzovkova-hZCGpX7pb9U-unsplash-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/671843c6898b1c3a97234c98_polina-kuzovkova-hZCGpX7pb9U-unsplash-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/671843c6898b1c3a97234c98_polina-kuzovkova-hZCGpX7pb9U-unsplash-p-1080.avif 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/671843c6898b1c3a97234c98_polina-kuzovkova-hZCGpX7pb9U-unsplash.avif 1920w" alt="Indonesian man" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/671843c6898b1c3a97234c98_polina-kuzovkova-hZCGpX7pb9U-unsplash.avif" loading="lazy" class="bt-layout-team-image"/></div></div><div class="bt-margin-bottom margin-xsmall"><div class="bt-team-title-wrapper"><div class="bt-heading-style-h4">Yuka</div><div class="bt-margin-top margin-xsmall"><div class="bt-text-style-regular">Founder</div></div></div></div></div><div id="w-node-_89b0884e-f97a-da6e-4ad9-266d29672667-37ce6fff" class="bt-layout-team-empty-space"></div><div id="w-node-_89b0884e-f97a-da6e-4ad9-266d29672668-37ce6fff" class="bt-layout-team-empty-space"></div><div class="bt-layout-team-item item-padding"><div class="bt-margin-bottom margin-small"><div class="bt-layout-team-image-wrapper"><img sizes="(max-width: 2360px) 100vw, 2360px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/671843c626df80636630bf1b_polina-kuzovkova-0OkidWKbO2Q-unsplash-p-500.avif 500w, 