 class="bt-heading-style-h4">Rita</div><div class="bt-margin-top margin-xsmall"><div class="bt-text-style-regular">Business Manager</div></div></div></div></div><div id="w-node-_89b0884e-f97a-da6e-4ad9-266d29672692-37ce6fff" class="bt-layout-team-empty-space"></div><div id="w-node-_89b0884e-f97a-da6e-4ad9-266d29672693-37ce6fff" class="bt-layout-team-empty-space"></div><div class="bt-layout-team-item"><div class="bt-margin-bottom margin-small"><div class="bt-layout-team-image-wrapper"><img sizes="(max-width: 4672px) 100vw, 4672px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/671843c609f47dab2c5457cf_polina-kuzovkova-g5O60VhyiHA-unsplash-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/671843c609f47dab2c5457cf_polina-kuzovkova-g5O60VhyiHA-unsplash-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/671843c609f47dab2c5457cf_polina-kuzovkova-g5O60VhyiHA-unsplash-p-1080.avif 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/671843c609f47dab2c5457cf_polina-kuzovkova-g5O60VhyiHA-unsplash-p-1600.avif 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/671843c609f47dab2c5457cf_polina-kuzovkova-g5O60VhyiHA-unsplash-p-2000.avif 2000w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/671843c609f47dab2c5457cf_polina-kuzovkova-g5O60VhyiHA-unsplash.avif 4672w" alt="Pak" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/671843c609f47dab2c5457cf_polina-kuzovkova-g5O60VhyiHA-unsplash.avif" loading="lazy" class="bt-layout-team-image"/></div></div><div class="bt-margin-bottom margin-xsmall"><div class="bt-team-title-wrapper"><div class="bt-heading-style-h4">Agus</div><div class="bt-margin-top margin-xsmall"><div class="bt-text-style-regular">Marketing &amp; Travel Advisor</div></div></div></div></div><div id="w-node-_89b0884e-f97a-da6e-4ad9-266d296726a8-37ce6fff" class="bt-layout-team-empty-space"></div><div id="w-node-_89b0884e-f97a-da6e-4ad9-266d296726a9-37ce6fff" class="bt-layout-team-empty-space"></div><div class="bt-layout-team-item"><div class="bt-margin-bottom margin-small"><div class="bt-layout-team-image-wrapper"><img sizes="(max-width: 4000px) 100vw, 4000px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/671843df2e0dbb8205f73c4f_polina-kuzovkova-KpcT-RxCaiU-unsplash-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/671843df2e0dbb8205f73c4f_polina-kuzovkova-KpcT-RxCaiU-unsplash-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/671843df2e0dbb8205f73c4f_polina-kuzovkova-KpcT-RxCaiU-unsplash-p-1080.avif 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/671843df2e0dbb8205f73c4f_polina-kuzovkova-KpcT-RxCaiU-unsplash-p-1600.avif 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/671843df2e0dbb8205f73c4f_polina-kuzovkova-KpcT-RxCaiU-unsplash-p-2000.avif 2000w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/671843df2e0dbb8205f73c4f_polina-kuzovkova-KpcT-RxCaiU-unsplash.avif 4000w" alt="Ibu" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/671843df2e0dbb8205f73c4f_polina-kuzovkova-KpcT-RxCaiU-unsplash.avif" loading="lazy" class="bt-layout-team-image"/></div></div><div class="bt-heading-style-h4">Lisa</div><div class="bt-margin-bottom margin-xsmall"><div class="bt-team-title-wrapper"><div class="bt-margin-top margin-xsmall"><div class="bt-text-style-regular">Travel Agent</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="bt-section-layout-content"><div class="bt-padding-global"><div class="bt-container-large"><div class="bt-padding-section-large"><div class="bt-layout-content-component"><div class="bt-margin-bottom margin-xxlarge align-middle"><div class="bt-max-width-large align-center"><div class="bt-content-wrapper"><div class="bt-margin-bottom margin-small"><h2 blocks-non-deletable="true" id="w-node-_5dbece1d-561d-418a-51bd-d2464474fb9b-37ce6fff" class="bt-heading-style-h2 position-middle">Our Philosophy: Authentic Experiences, Designed for You</h2></div><p class="bt-text-style-regular">At Bali Travel, our philosophy is rooted in the belief that every journey should be personal, meaningful, and unforgettable. We don’t believe in cookie-cutter vacations; instead, we design each trip with care, tailoring every detail to reflect your unique interests and desires. Whether you&#x27;re dreaming of serene beaches, cultural immersion, adventurous activities, or wellness retreats, we make sure your Bali experience aligns perfectly with what you envision.<br/><br/>Authenticity is at the heart of everything we do. We are passionate about sharing the real Bali—the one beyond the tourist hotspots. With the help of our local guides and partners, we introduce you to hidden temples, traditional villages, and secret beaches that capture the essence of the island. We connect you with local artisans, authentic dining experiences, and cultural encounters that give you a deeper understanding of Bali’s heritage and lifestyle.<br/><br/>Our team’s goal is to make your journey as seamless and enjoyable as possible. From handpicking boutique accommodations and arranging personalized tours to managing all your transfers and special requests, we take care of every detail so you can relax and immerse yourself fully in the experience. Whether you’re traveling solo, as a couple, or with a group, we are here to ensure every moment</p></div></div></div><div class="bt-layout-content-image-wrapper"><img sizes="(max-width: 6154px) 100vw, 6154px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/671746351f3baab437ce707a_david-gor-7ABPUyR0Pgs-unsplash.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/671746351f3baab437ce707a_david-gor-7ABPUyR0Pgs-unsplash.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/671746351f3baab437ce707a_david-gor-7ABPUyR0Pgs-unsplash.avif 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/671746351f3baab437ce707a_david-gor-7ABPUyR0Pgs-unsplash.avif 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/671746351f3baab437ce707a_david-gor-7ABPUyR0Pgs-unsplash.avif 2000w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/671746351f3baab437ce707a_david-gor-7ABPUyR0Pgs-unsplash.avif 2600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/671746351f3baab437ce707a_david-gor-7ABPUyR0Pgs-unsplash.avif 6154w" alt="Bali Uluwatu" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671746351f3baab437ce6ff4/671746351f3baab437ce707a_david-gor-7ABPUyR0Pgs-unsplash.avif" loading="lazy" class="bt-layout-content-image"/></div><div class="bt-margin-top margin-xxlarge align-middle"><div class="bt-max-width-large align-center"><div class="bt-content-wrapper"><div class="bt-margin-bottom margin-small"><h2 blocks-non-deletable="true" id="w-node-a57a8185-2856-1cf0-331b-e8d1ff109bda-37ce6fff" class="bt-heading-style-h2 position-middle">Additional services</h2></div><p class="bt-text-style-regular">At Bali Travel, we go beyond just creating unforgettable itineraries. To enhance your experience and ensure your journey is smooth and stress-free, we offer a range of additional services tailored to meet your needs.<br/><br/>‍<strong>Airport Transfers:</strong> Seamless pick-up and drop-off services to start and end your trip hassle-free.<br/><br/>‍<strong>Private Tours &amp; Excursions:</strong> Enjoy exclusive, guided tours designed around your interests.<br/><br/>‍<strong>Restaurant Reservations:</strong> Let us secure tables at Bali’s best dining spots, from beachfront cafes to fine dining.<br/><br/>‍<strong>Wellness Experiences:</strong> Book yoga classes, spa treatments, or wellness retreats for ultimate relaxation.<br/><br/>‍<strong>Custom Event Planning:</strong> Whether it’s a romantic dinner or a group celebration, we’ll handle the details.<br/><br/>‍<strong>24/7 Customer Support:</strong> Our team is available around the clock to assist you with any requests or issues during your trip.<br/><br/>‍<strong>Flight Assistance:</strong> We can help coordinate flight bookings and changes for a smooth travel experience.<br/><br/>Whatever you need, our team is ready to go the extra mile to make your Bali adventure effortless and extraordinary. Just let us know your preferences, and we’ll take care of the rest!<br/></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="bt-section-layout-contact"><div class="bt-padding-global"><div class="bt-container-large"><div class="bt-padding-section-large"><div class="w-layout-grid bt-layout-contact-content"><div class="bt-layout-contact-content-left"><div class="bt-margin-bottom margin-medium"><div class="bt-contact-heading-wrapper"><div class="bt-margin-bottom margin-xsmall"><h2 blocks-non-deletable="true" class="bt-heading-style-h2">Contact us</h2></div><p class="bt-text-style-regular">Contact us for more information.</p></div></div><div class="bt-layout-contact-contact-list"><div id="w-node-_65a03bcc-538d-f5d9-9f78-ab936df9c05a-37ce6fff" class="bt-layout-contact-item-small"><div class="bt-layout-contact-icon-wrapper-small"><div class="bt-icon-embed-xsmall w-embed"><svg width=" 100%" height=" 100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
